{"book":"1-kings","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T11:28:02.229181825Z","verse":20,"ref":"1-kings 3:20","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":3,"translation":"So she rose ⟨in the middle of⟩ the night and took ⟨את⟩ my son from beside me — and your handmaid ⟨was⟩ asleep — and laid him in her bosom; and ⟨את⟩ her son, the dead one, she laid in my bosom.","tokens":[{"surface":"ותקם","gloss":"And she arose"},{"surface":"בתוך","gloss":"in the middle of"},{"surface":"הלילה","gloss":"the night"},{"surface":"ותקח","gloss":"and took"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"my son"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"my son"},{"surface":"מאצלי","gloss":"from beside me"},{"surface":"ואמתך","gloss":"and your handmaid"},{"surface":"ישנה","gloss":"⟨was⟩ asleep"},{"surface":"ותשכיבהו","gloss":"and laid him"},{"surface":"בחיקה","gloss":"in her bosom"},{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"and ⟨את⟩","marks":"her son"},{"surface":"בנה","gloss":"her son"},{"surface":"המת","gloss":"the dead one"},{"surface":"השכיבה","gloss":"she laid"},{"surface":"בחיקי","gloss":"in my bosom"}]}